        "outline_action": "Search for studies that directly quantify inosine concentrations in human tumour biopsies or microdialysates. If only plasma data is available, clarify whether the gap requires intra-tumoral specificity or if systemic correlates are acceptable per the success criteria definition of 'tumour-adjacent material'. Note that this study provides strong associative evidence via plasma levels but lacks the direct intra-tumoral measurement required to fully satisfy the 'inside the human tumour microenvironment' criterion.",
