        "remaining_gap": "The specific measured concentration value of inosine inside the human tumour microenvironment (TME) is not provided. The study measures inosine in plasma (serum) of human RCC patients and in mouse plasma/tumours, but does not report direct quantification of inosine within the solid human tumour tissue itself. Furthermore, while the association between plasma inosine levels and survival is established, no absolute concentration values (e.g., ng/mL or μM) for human plasma or TME are explicitly stated in the text.",
