          "该综述涵盖了多种代谢物，但重点在于其与ICIs（主要是PD-1/PD-L1和CTLA-4）的相互作用。对于其他免疫疗法（如CAR-T）的提及较少，需注意适用范围。",
          "文中引用的临床数据多来自小样本队列或回顾性分析，需谨慎推断其普遍性。",
          "同一代谢物在不同癌症类型和不同ICIs靶点下可能具有相反的作用，解读时必须严格区分具体情境，避免过度泛化。",
          "机制描述主要基于动物模型和体外实验，人体内的实际生理病理过程可能存在差异。"
        ],
        "topic_handles": [
          "Short-chain fatty acids (SCFAs) - acetate, propionate, butyrate, valerate",
          "Inosine metabolism and Th1 differentiation",
          "Trimethylamine N-oxide (TMAO) and pyroptosis",
          "Tryptophan metabolites (Indoles, ILA, IPA) and AhR signaling",
          "Secondary bile acids (3-oxoLCA, isoLCA) and Th17 suppression",
          "Muropeptides and NOD2 signaling",
          "Exopolysaccharides (EPS-R1) and CCR6+ T cells",
          "FimH adhesin and TLR4/NK cell activation",
          "Castalagin and microbiota-dependent anti-PD-1 response"
        ]
      },
